# SHA-256 of each file setup-aztec downloads before it runs the Aztec installer, keyed by path:
#   <aztec version>/install and <aztec version>/versions, from https://install.aztec-labs.com/
#   noir/<noir version>/<asset>, from the noir-lang/noir release that versions file names
#   foundry/<foundry version>/<asset>, from the foundry-rs/foundry release that versions file names
# An Aztec bump re-pins them in one commit (the aztec-update skill has the procedure).
